@IE3_Quiz_with_lesson_api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7150

### 1. Get All Books (200 OK)
GET {{IE3_Quiz_with_lesson_api_HostAddress}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create a Book (201 Created)
POST {{IE3_Quiz_with_lesson_api_HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Domain-Driven Design",
  "author": "Eric Evans",
  "isAvailable": true,
  "yearPublished": 2003
}

### 3. Update a Book (204 No Content)
PUT {{IE3_Quiz_with_lesson_api_HostAddress}}/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Clean Architecture (Updated)",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isAvailable": true,
  "yearPublished": 2017
}

### 4. Delete a Book (204 No Content)
DELETE {{IE3_Quiz_with_lesson_api_HostAddress}}/api/books/2